// M7b scenario: as M5, but Red attacks with a mixed force (one tank platoon, two IFV platoons)
// and Blue has a recon section forward. Tests ammunition choice: sabot for tanks, HEAT and
// HE for IFVs; Red tanks carry ERA. Play as Blue: occupy battle positions (B), set weapons
// control, and hold the objective until the time limit. The Blue AI plan is used only when
// the side is not player-controlled (headless runs, tests).
