    briefing: "SITUATION: A MIXED RED FORCE OF TANKS AND INFANTRY FIGHTING VEHICLES IS EXPECTED FROM THE NORTH-EAST AT FIRST LIGHT.\n\nMISSION: 1ST AND 2ND PLATOONS HOLD THE VILLAGE CROSSROADS FOR 45 MINUTES. RED WINS BY HOLDING THE VILLAGE UNCONTESTED FOR 2 MINUTES. A SIDE THAT LOSES 70 % OF ITS VEHICLES LOSES.\n\nNOTES: RED TANKS CARRY EXPLOSIVE REACTIVE ARMOUR; SHAPED CHARGES AND MISSILES ARE PARTLY DEFEATED. CREWS CHOOSE SABOT AGAINST TANKS AND HEAT AGAINST IFVS (Q HOLDS A TYPE). USE THE PLANNING PHASE. OCCUPY BATTLE POSITIONS (B) FACING NE, DRAW A PHASE LINE, THEN EXECUTE (ENTER).",
